# @gibli-labs/control-plane-client is published to the GitHub Packages npm
# registry (#616). Installing needs a token with read:packages — CI passes the
# workflow GITHUB_TOKEN; locally export NODE_AUTH_TOKEN (a PAT), see README.
# With the token unset, registry fetches fail with a 401 (no silent fallback);
# npm commands that don't hit the registry still work.
@gibli-labs:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
//npm.pkg.github.com/:_authToken=${NODE_AUTH_TOKEN}
